# Code owners for the paths that control how Gunmetal is built, checked and
# released, and for the security-sensitive source (SEC-SUP-005,
# SEC-STD-035). A change to any of them needs a code owner's approval once
# the ruleset on main requires code-owner review. Once two maintainers
# exist, the approver must not be the author.
#
# Later lines take precedence over earlier ones. Directory patterns cover
# paths the plan creates in later waves, so a package that adds a
# security-sensitive path already listed here does not edit this file.

# Workflows, Dependabot, the pull-request template and this file.
